# macOS finder droppings — never part of the site
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# The README is the map of the whole system, including where the soft spots
# are. GitHub Pages serves every committed file, so it stays in the working
# copy ("website v2/README.md") and off the domain.
README.md

# Backend setup scripts. These were live at onlyibee.com/member/*.sql in the
# 2026-08-17 audit, handing out the schema, every RPC signature and a real
# address. They stay in the working copy and get pasted into the Supabase SQL
# editor by hand — never committed, never served.
member/*.sql

# Local-only tooling: IBEE STUDIO, the shop/garment managers, the newsroom, the
# pass minter and the generators (share pages, beat data, thumbs). They are
# authoring tools, not pages. Eight of them were still tracked after the audit
# clear-out and served at onlyibee.com/tools/ — .gitignore cannot untrack what
# is already committed, so they were git rm --cached'd as well.
tools/
